## Containerization Flow

The complete frontend flow is:

``` text
Mohalla React source
        |
        v
Docker build
        |
        +--> Stage 1: Node 20 Alpine
        |       |
        |       +--> npm ci
        |       +--> receive VITE_* build arguments
        |       +--> npm run build
        |       |
        |       +--> /app/dist
        |
        v
Stage 2: Nginx Unprivileged
        |
        +--> copy /app/dist
        +--> copy nginx.conf
        |
        v
Nginx listening on :8080
        |
        v
Kubernetes Service / Ingress
        |
        v
Browser
```
